
This is the brawling tournament in [[Black and Blue]].

I'm thinking a card game style mini game.

Each fighter builds a deck, which must contain:

6 x Jab (Deal Damage = STR Score)
2 x Block (Reduce Damage = CON Mod)
2 x Dodge (Reduce Damage = DEX mod)
2 x Deep Breath (Draw 3)

And 6 more of Jab, Block, or Dodge in any Combination.
Finally, each fighter gets custom cards based of their Base Class which can help them out.

Play is simple, roll intimadation, initative, or performance to determine who goes first.
Everyone starts with 3 cards.

On your turn, you can either play an Action card or draw a card.

In response to an Action card, a player can play a Reaction card, often to reduce damage.

At the end of every 2 Rounds, the audience gets to play:
"Encourage" (One fighter gets +CHA mod to next attack)
"Insult" (One fighter loses the ability to play Reaction cards for the next round) 
"Cheer" (Both fighers gain a "Climatic Blow" in their draw pile)

Climactic Blow (Deal Damage = 2 x Strength Score, play as Reaction to Climactic Blow to reduce damage to 0)

